# Trillion AI Tech — Environment Variables Example
#
# This static website currently requires NO environment variables.
#
# Future products or services may require environment variables
# (for example, API keys or configuration), but at present this
# site is a static public catalogue with no backend.
#
# Do not place real credentials in this file or any .env file.
#
# If you add environment variables in future, list them here
# with safe placeholder values only, for example:
#
# EXAMPLE_API_KEY=your_api_key_here
# EXAMPLE_SERVICE_URL=https://example.com
